    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Souls Alive: Origins</strong> is a survival\u2011horror adventure defined by atmosphere. Realistic visuals, dramatic lighting and a layered soundscape pull you into every corridor. Narrative leads the way through fragmented logs, eerie transmissions and impossible relics, but staying to read them means surviving sudden, brutal combat where every shot counts.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990130/extras/1a93b2bfbd59bee605cc849f5ed7a1ca.avif?t=1749305733\" data-has-big /></div><br>A remote desert world where Oxite\u2014the crystal that makes super\u2011luminal flight a reality\u2014is torn from the dunes by an isolated mining colony. During deep\u2011core drilling the crew uncovered the ruins of a long\u2011dead civilization and, while probing its cyclopean vaults, awakened the Great Old One they once worshipped: Cthulhu. Now the entire settlement teeters on the brink of annihilation, and you\u2014the last functional communications officer\u2014must reach the orbital uplink and transmit a distress call before the nightmare consumes everyone.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990130/extras/64420e6a1df3989166d6c4e6e56325e4.avif?t=1749305733\" data-has-big /></div><br>In the waking world you creep through half\u2011powered corridors, scavenge tools and juggle a tight inventory to solve engineering conundrums while confronting a Cthulhu cult reborn through prophecy\u2014one in which you are both witness and unwilling participant. Then the sand yawns and you are dragged into a labyrinthine dreamscape where the Old One\u2019s presence is constant, physics unravels, and space loops back on itself. Here, non\u2011Euclidean puzzles twist stairways into M\u00f6bius knots and reveal chambers that cannot share the same volume, challenging memory as much as courage.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Souls Alive: Origins</strong> is a survival\u2011horror adventure defined by atmosphere. Realistic visuals, dramatic lighting and a layered soundscape pull you into every corridor. Narrative leads the way through fragmented logs, eerie transmissions and impossible relics, but staying to read them means surviving sudden, brutal combat where every shot counts.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990130/extras/1a93b2bfbd59bee605cc849f5ed7a1ca.avif?t=1749305733\" data-has-big /></div><br>A remote desert world where Oxite\u2014the crystal that makes super\u2011luminal flight a reality\u2014is torn from the dunes by an isolated mining colony. During deep\u2011core drilling the crew uncovered the ruins of a long\u2011dead civilization and, while probing its cyclopean vaults, awakened the Great Old One they once worshipped: Cthulhu. Now the entire settlement teeters on the brink of annihilation, and you\u2014the last functional communications officer\u2014must reach the orbital uplink and transmit a distress call before the nightmare consumes everyone.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990130/extras/64420e6a1df3989166d6c4e6e56325e4.avif?t=1749305733\" data-has-big /></div><br>In the waking world you creep through half\u2011powered corridors, scavenge tools and juggle a tight inventory to solve engineering conundrums while confronting a Cthulhu cult reborn through prophecy\u2014one in which you are both witness and unwilling participant. Then the sand yawns and you are dragged into a labyrinthine dreamscape where the Old One\u2019s presence is constant, physics unravels, and space loops back on itself. Here, non\u2011Euclidean puzzles twist stairways into M\u00f6bius knots and reveal chambers that cannot share the same volume, challenging memory as much as courage.</p>",
    "short_description": "Souls Alive: Origins is a Lovecraftian survival horror game set in a dark sci-fi future. Explore a world where reality bends, ancient cults return, and Cthulhu stirs once more. With a strong focus on story, atmosphere, and visual detail.",
